==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Cadaver Bear as the boss may be alarming at first with its long-range burrow, but the bear's burrowing is an easily abusable loophole, so refrain from bringing Holy Blast. Use [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] to rid of the starting peons, and let a Can Can trigger the base. ''If your [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] has its talents unlocked, you must send him as soon as the base is triggered.'' This is to avoid the case of his Explosion hitting Cadaver Bear out of his burrow and shredding all of your units. Use the brief window of time when Cadaver Bear is underground to send in Bahamut and win.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
-

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Quickly deploy a meatshield or an attacker to take the wave attack of Axoloty, once that has been done, dispatch of the Shibalien and Zoge with cats like [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] and then when having enough cash deploy talented [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] who can singlehandedly kill Axoloty and the other peons.

